      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "查看 Linux 系统版本分为两大类：内核版本 与 发行版本，本文整理全部常用命令。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、查看 Linux 内核版本"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一查看-linux-内核版本"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.1 cat /proc/version"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "11-cat-procversion"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "/proc 目录存储当前内核运行状态的特殊文件（内存、CPU、已安装文件系统等）。正在运行的内核信息存于 /proc/version 虚拟文件中。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ cat /proc/version\nLinux version 3.10.0-1062.18.1.el7.x86_64 (mockbuild@kbuilder.bsys.centos.org) (gcc version 4.8.5 20150623 (Red Hat 4.8.5-39) (GCC) ) #1 SMP Tue Mar 17 23:49:17 UTC 2020"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.2 uname -a"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "12-uname-a"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "uname 用于查看多个系统信息，包括内核体系结构、名称、版本和发行版。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ uname -a\nLinux VM_0_16_centos 3.10.0-1062.18.1.el7.x86_64 #1 SMP Tue Mar 17 23:49:17 UTC 2020 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "uname 常用参数（补充）"
          }
        ]
      },
