          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、查看 Linux 发行版本"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二查看-linux-发行版本"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 lsb_release -a（通用）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-lsb_release-a通用"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "查看完整版本信息：系统名称、版本号、代号。适用于所有发行版（Debian/Ubuntu/CentOS）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ lsb_release -a\nLSB Version:    :core-4.1-amd64:core-4.1-noarch:cxx-4.1-amd64:cxx-4.1-noarch:desktop-4.1-amd64:desktop-4.1-noarch:languages-4.1-amd64:languages-4.1-noarch:printing-4.1-amd64:printing-4.1-noarch\nDistributor ID: CentOS\nDescription:    CentOS Linux release 7.7.1908 (Core)\nRelease:        7.7.1908\nCodename:       Core"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "注：CentOS 8+ / 新版本可能默认未安装 lsb_release，需 yum install redhat-lsb-core（补充）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 cat /etc/issue（通用，简略）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-cat-etcissue通用简略"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "仅显示系统名称和版本号。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ cat /etc/issue\nCentOS Linux release 7.7.1908 (Core)\nKernel \\r on an \\m"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 cat /etc/redhat-release（RedHat 系）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-cat-etcredhat-releaseredhat-系"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ cat /etc/redhat-release\nCentOS Linux release 7.7.1908 (Core)"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.4 rpm -q redhat-release（RedHat 系）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "24-rpm-q-redhat-releaseredhat-系"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ rpm -q redhat-release\nredhat-release-4AS-3"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.5 hostnamectl（systemd 系统）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "25-hostnamectlsystemd-系统"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "systemd 的一部分，查询/更改主机名，同时显示发行版和内核版本。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ hostnamectl\n   Static hostname: VM_0_16_centos\n         Icon name: computer-vm\n           Chassis: vm\n        Machine ID: f9d400c5e1e8c3a8209e990d887d4ac1\n           Boot ID: ee7e8dec79274c90be37dfbae08e6b65\n    Virtualization: kvm\n  Operating System: CentOS Linux 7 (Core)\n       CPE OS Name: cpe:/o:centos:centos:7\n            Kernel: Linux 3.10.0-1062.18.1.el7.x86_64\n      Architecture: x86-64"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "仅查内核版本："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ hostnamectl | grep -i kernel\n  Kernel: Linux 3.10.0-1062.18.1.el7.x86_64"
      },
